pr.description:
Fixes #128081.

The optimized clone method ends up as the following MIR:

```
_2 = copy ((*_1).0: i32);
_3 = copy ((*_1).1: u64);
_4 = copy ((*_1).2: [i8; 3]);
_0 = Foo { a: move _2, b: move _3, c: move _4 };
```

We can transform this to:

```
_0 = copy (*_1);
```

